From: kevinzhow <kevinzhow@local>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 06:00:55 +0900
Subject: Recording quick setting: this project's recorder (KWin screencast
 stream, shared codec)

The quick setting records the KWin screencast stream through the shared Android codec instead of
KPipeWire. Its sources are this repository's plasma/recording, placed into quicksettings/record by
the recipe's overlay (they replace recordutil.* and the QML wholesale); this patch builds them.

Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-09-26
X-Rungic-Status: Inappropriate [uses the Android hardware codec bridge of this project]
X-Rungic-Tests: L3:recording.quicksetting
X-Rungic-Docs: docs/46 docs/61
---
 quicksettings/record/CMakeLists.txt | 18 ++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/quicksettings/record/CMakeLists.txt b/quicksettings/record/CMakeLists.txt
index 1265a06..a828d85 100644
--- a/quicksettings/record/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/quicksettings/record/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,22 +1,28 @@
 # SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2022 Devin Lin <devin@kde.org>
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
 
+# Rungic (docs/46, docs/61): the recording quick setting is the project's own
+# (plasma/recording, linked here): it records KWin's screencast stream with
+# the shared codec instead of KPipeWire, so it is built with plasma-mobile
+# rather than installed over the packaged plugin.
+find_package(Qt6 REQUIRED COMPONENTS GuiPrivate)
+
 ecm_add_qml_module(recordplugin URI "org.kde.plasma.quicksetting.record" GENERATE_PLUGIN_SOURCE)
 
-target_sources(recordplugin PRIVATE recordutil.cpp)
+target_sources(recordplugin PRIVATE recordutil.cpp recordutil.h screenstream.cpp screenstream.h)
+
+qt6_generate_wayland_protocol_client_sources(recordplugin FILES
+    ${PLASMA_WAYLAND_PROTOCOLS_DIR}/zkde-screencast-unstable-v1.xml)
 
 target_link_libraries(recordplugin PRIVATE
     Qt::Core
-    Qt::DBus
+    Qt::GuiPrivate
+    Qt::WaylandClient
     Qt::Qml
     Qt::Quick
     KF6::CoreAddons
-    KF6::ConfigCore
-    KF6::ConfigGui
     KF6::I18n
     KF6::Notifications
-    K::KPipeWire
-    K::KPipeWireRecord
 )
 
 ecm_finalize_qml_module(recordplugin)
